This project is an independent MCP-first integration layer for machine learning
research and experiment execution.

Upstream inspiration and references:

- Hugging Face ml-intern: research planning, paper/dataset/code discovery, and
  tool-routing patterns.
- Andrej Karpathy's autoresearch: fixed-budget local experiment loops,
  program.md instructions, train.py edits, metrics, and accept/reject review.
- AIDE / aideml: experiment tree, best-node tracking, and improve/debug loop
  organization.
- PaperBench: reproduction specifications, required-file readiness checks,
  rubric-style evaluation, and grade reports.

AIDE and PaperBench are architecture references in this repository, not runtime
dependencies. The default Codex/Claude path uses this project's MCP contract,
task protocol, local artifacts, and release gate.

Third-party dependencies keep their own licenses. Review dependency metadata
before redistributing packaged builds.
